			<DisplayName>Light Resource Claim Pylon</DisplayName>
			<Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\Cubes\KJN_KWP_RES_ResourceClaimPylon_Light.dds</Icon>
			<Description>A powerful mining pylon by AED (Advanced Exploration Dynamics) capable of extracting ore deposits without consuming them. Placing it near other pylons will cause a decrease in yield efficiency.

Base Ore Output: 10 units per cycle
Mining Range: 300m (350m depth)
Ally Interferrence Range: 2km
Enemy Suppression Range: 5km
Interference Penalty: 10%
Suppression Penalty: 10%</Description>
			<CubeSize>Large</CubeSize>
			<GuiVisible>false</GuiVisible>
			<BlockTopology>TriangleMesh</BlockTopology>
			<Size x="1" y="4" z="2" />
